{
  "dom_id": "step-40313",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Categorizing a Polynomial by Its Degree and Number of Terms",
  "problem": "Categorize the polynomial $1+2x^2 - 8x$ based on its degree and the number of terms it has.",
  "worked_solution": "The polynomial $1+2x^2 - 8x$ has three terms, so it is a trinomial.\n\nAlso, its degree is $2,$ so it is quadratic. \n\nTherefore, the polynomial is a quadratic trinomial.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
